# Generated audit reports carry product/integration names + production uuids straight
# out of the catalog. They are operator artifacts, produced fresh on every run — never
# committed. The dated measurement that matters lives in README.md.
report-*.json

# Per-run backups, generated SQL and the rollback that undoes it. Written before every
# write (including dry-run) so the exact bytes applied can be reviewed and reversed;
# they are a full dump of the integrations table and do not belong in git.
backups/
